Title: Whitby memorial bench for Sophie Lancaster moved for big wheel
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'A spokesperson for charity the Sophie Lancaster Foundation', 'Text': 'they were "shocked" to find the bench had been temporarily relocated and the organisation had not been consulted on the move.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 70, 'EndChar': 176}}, {'Speaker': 'North Yorkshire Council spokesperson', 'Text': 'the big wheel was "intended as a respectful, exciting addition to the town" and the memorial would be restored to its original location on 4 August.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 34, 'EndChar': 168}}, {'Speaker': 'charity spokesperson', 'Text': '"For Sylvia, Sophie\'s mother, the bench was a tangible connection to Sophie,"', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 69}}, {'Speaker': 'charity spokesperson', 'Text': '"It was a shock to learn that the bench has been removed to locate a giant sightseeing wheel. Unfortunately, we weren\'t informed or consulted about this decision.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 139}}, {'Speaker': 'charity spokesperson', 'Text': '"Which makes the news even more difficult for us and no doubt for the many thousands of people who visit the bench to reflect and remember Sophie."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 130}}, {'Speaker': 'Whitby mayor, councillor Sandra Turner', 'Text': 'this "a serious oversight".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 104, 'EndChar': 128}}, {'Speaker': 'Whitby mayor, councillor Sandra Turner', 'Text': '"We have raised this with North Yorkshire Council, they have apologised for the serious oversight and assured us it will not happen again," she said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 13, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 129}}, {'Speaker': 'Whitby mayor, councillor Sandra Turner', 'Text': 'She added that it had been a "serious hiccup" in the relationship between the local authorities.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 86}}, {'Speaker': 'North Yorkshire councillor Mark Crane', 'Text': 'the wheel had been put up as part of a wider tourism strategy.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 32, 'EndChar': 91}}, {'Speaker': 'North Yorkshire councillor Mark Crane', 'Text': '"The location of the wheel in Whitby was chosen to provide stunning views across the harbour and towards the town\'s famous abbey," he said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 16, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 124}}, {'Speaker': 'North Yorkshire councillor Mark Crane', 'Text': '"Initial feedback from local businesses shows overwhelming support, with traders on West Cliff hopeful the attraction will increase footfall.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 17, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 124}}, {'Speaker': 'North Yorkshire councillor Mark Crane', 'Text': '"Having been in other parts of the county, the wheel has been well received by residents, visitors, and local businesses."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 18, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 104}}, {'Speaker': 'North Yorkshire councillor Mark Crane', 'Text': 'He added that the decision to install the wheel was made "in good faith to avoid delays", and that council officers would attend the next town council meeting to acknowledge the importance of local engagement.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 19, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 169}}, {'Speaker': 'A spokesperson for the Sophie Lancaster Foundation', 'Text': "it would be holding a small ceremony to rededicate the bench at Tomorrow's Ghosts Festival on 1 November.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 20, 'StartChar': 42, 'EndChar': 132}}, {'Speaker': 'A spokesperson for the Sophie Lancaster Foundation', 'Text': '"Whitby is such a special place for us and we will be overjoyed when the bench returns to its home on West Cliff," they said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 21, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 108}}, {'Speaker': 'A spokesperson for the Sophie Lancaster Foundation', 'Text': '"As always, it was wonderful how the alternative community responded to the incident, and their love for Sophie and affection for the foundation set up in her memory, is truly heart-warming."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 22, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 177}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'A bench dedicated to a murdered woman has been moved to make way for a giant sightseeing wheel.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 77}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'looking up through the spokes of a white Ferris wheel.'}]}
